# Google Play Store Analysis

## Project Overview

This project analyzes **Google Play Store application data using Tableau** to understand application distribution, category-level ratings, installation performance, free vs paid applications, and application update trends.

The project converts cleaned Google Play Store data into an interactive Tableau dashboard using multiple visualizations to identify patterns in application performance and user engagement.

## Objectives

* Analyze the number of applications across categories
* Compare average application ratings by category
* Analyze installation volumes across categories
* Compare free and paid applications
* Analyze application update trends over time
* Build an interactive Tableau dashboard for application performance analysis

